{title: Living Water}
{artist: Heidi Robertson, Aaron Robertson}
{genre: Modern Worship}
{style: Ballad}
{flow: Meditative, Response}
{key: C}
{tempo: 95}
{time: 4/4}
{license: WorshipCommons License 1.0}
{copyright: © 2025 Aaron and Heidi Robertson}
{c: © 2025 Aaron and Heidi Robertson · WorshipCommons License 1.0 (free for worship) https://worshipcommons.org/license · Source: https://worshipcommons.org/songs/living-water-zFPJfgHkmVu/}
{c: Chords: the writer's own chart}

{start_of_verse: Intro}
[Cmaj7]Ooh, [A7sus2]ooh
[F]Ooh, [G2]ooh
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Cmaj7]Restore my soul
[A7sus2]And take control
[F]Living Water, [G2]Living Water
[Cmaj7]Come lift me up
[A7sus2]And fill my cup
[F]Living Water, [G2]Living Water
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Cmaj7]You drown my fears
[A7sus2]And wash my tears
[F]Living Water, [G2]Living Water
[Cmaj7]You give sweet rest
[A7sus2]That floods my chest
[F]Living Water, [G2]Living Water
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[Am7]Flow through [F]me [C]as the [G4]sea
[Am7]Live in [F]me [C]pure and [G4]free [G]
Overflow my [Am7]soul
Till my spirit is [F]full
And my [C]heart is [G4]whole in [G]You
Living [Am7]Water
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge}
[Dm7]All other [Am7]springs are dry
I [F2]long for You (long for You)
[Dm7]Only You [Am7]satisfy
I [F2]thirst for You (thirst for You)
{end_of_bridge}
